WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:07.320
Bro!  Did you really die?

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.570
I’m so sad that I can’t stand up.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.330
Huh?  What?

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.660
What’s this?

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.330
I really can’t stand up!

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.730
What's happening?

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.710
What is this?

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:36.580
It's the first time I’ve 
seen something this fun.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.980
Hooray!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.150
I feel bad that Bro is gone, but...

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.300
Roboppi will open it!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.650
Click!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.230
Hooray!  I wonder what's here?

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:57.400
What’s this?

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:23.280
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:30.070
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:37.390
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:43.960
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:50.710
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:57.940
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:04.650
I want to share your pain

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:38.480
Even the Dark Ignis’s sacrifice 
couldn't stop Bohman’s power.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.840
But it's Playmaker’s turn.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.610
We still have hope.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.150
Now you know why I said it was pointless.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.120
There’s no way you can win.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.120
I’ll never give up.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:01.500
I won’t let your sacrifice go to waste, Ai.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.830
I’m back.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.800
You came back early this time.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:16.270
Yeah.  I thought something like this might 
happen, so I put a backup inside Roboppi.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.000
Backup?

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.420
Yeah.  It was an all-or-nothing bet.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.220
What did you bet?

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.330
My existence.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.430
We have free will.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:40.560
So the odds of rebuilding my 
program exactly was very low.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:44.570
If I failed, I wouldn't be myself.  
It's the same as if I died.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.760
But I had to take that risk.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.640
Do you know what's going on?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:54.800
Yeah.  We stopped the Neuron Link, 
but Bohman’s Skills haven't.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.600
Exactly.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:00.450
So we must defeat him this turn.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:04.690
You're right.  But before 
that, I need a bit of time.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.900
What are you going to do?

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.560
Save my friends from inside Bohman!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:14.300
My previous attack destroyed a 
portion of Bohman’s program.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:19.540
So I can now go through Mirror 
LINK VRAINS to get inside him.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:24.010
With the help of my friends, we 
can definitely defeat Bohman!

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.320
Help of your friends…

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.880
But you don’t have a backup anymore.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.250
Be careful.  Make sure you come back.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.380
Those words make me happy.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.380
Here I go!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.020
Here I come, Bohman!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.730
Damn.  This is a very high-level system.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:54.250
I'd like to destroy this 
program, but no time for that!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.130
This is his core.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.160
Aqua!  Flame!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.130
Are you okay, Aqua?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.940
Ai, why are you here?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:17.010
I have two lives.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.140
Two?

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:20.860
I see.  A backup.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:26.170
That’s why you'd do 
something crazy.  Sheesh.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.680
Save your lectures for later!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.100
So this...

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:35.610
To use that monster, Bohman connected 
his Neuron Link with you.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.850
Just wait.  I’ll save you!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.170
What?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:46.770
It won't work, Ai.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:52.500
We are completely fused 
with a portion of Bohman.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:56.020
Bohman is compatible with us.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:00.540
No matter what you do, it won't work.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.370
I don’t believe that!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.040
It’s true, Ai.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:08.210
That’s why we know about Bohman.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.680
Leave now!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.680
The Neuron Link is rebuilding.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.690
If you don’t hurry, you can't go back!

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.640
I don’t want to!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:23.130
Just as I planned, we'll unite inside Bohman.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:29.570
Can you hear me, Bohman?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.090
Ai is here!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.050
So you’re alive.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.410
Dark Ignis.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.930
Absorb into me, Ai!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.320
Ai!  Leave now and defeat Bohman!

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.660
If the Neuron Link rebuilds, you can’t win!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.090
I know!

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:00.250
But if I defeat Bohman, you'll be erased!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.430
That’s true.

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.970
But there’s no other way.

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.210
Stop joking!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.490
Without your power, we can't defeat Bohman!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:12.680
And... if I lose you, 
this was all for nothing!

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:13.900
Ai…

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.100
Flame, lend him your power!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:33.700
What are you doing?

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:37.200
We're entrusting our power to Ai.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.700
What?  Don’t do that!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:48.180
Lightning, at your current strength, 
you can't stop my or Flame’s powers.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.760
Please take it, Ai.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.640
That is the last of our powers.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.430
Use it to defeat Bohman!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:10.210
But if I can’t save 
you, there’s no point-

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.440
Deal with it!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:14.050
What do you mean, deal with it?

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.050
Deal with it forever?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:21.160
Ai, we have close to eternal life.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:26.320
That’s why we've forgotten that those 
who have life will lose it someday.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:28.740
That moment just happens to be now.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.790
Even now you talk like a know-it-all!

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.790
Know-it-all…

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:38.150
That must mean I made a sound argument.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.730
Ai, you still don’t know the truth.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:46.680
The real truth that we’ll reach.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.940
Defeat Bohman, Ai!

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:53.120
Ai, you're our final hope.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.750
We’re counting on you.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.280
Now go!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.720
Damn!

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.100
Ai…

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:09.260
Become one with me, Ignis!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:17.600
Ai, you'll have to determine 
what path to take.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.880
I couldn’t save them.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:29.850
Flame, Aqua, Earth…

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:33.160
Everyone fused with Bohman.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.370
Ai…

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:38.160
There’s nothing left but to defeat Bohman!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.000
What’s this?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.370
They entrusted me with 
the last of their power!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.440
I won’t let your powers go to waste.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:56.170
So you escaped, Ai.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:10:02.150
But in the end, I'll absorb you in this duel.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:06.380
How dare you harm my friends!

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.990
I'll never forgive you!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:13.470
Quite the spirit.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:21.970
Even without my Perfectron's effects, 
due to Judgment Arrows, it has 8000 ATK.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:26.980
And even if your monster has higher ATK, 
its effect stops it from being destroyed.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.270
You still think you can destroy it?

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:33.650
They entrusted me with a bond to defeat you.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.510
That’s how I'll duel!

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:39.880
Fine.  Bring it on, Playmaker!

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.820
Here I go, Bohman!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.270
This is our final turn!

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.390
My turn.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.820
I draw!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.700
Threshold Borg's effect from my hand!

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:59.450
I discard Dotscaper to Special Summon it!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:05.050
And I Special Summon the Dotscaper 
that was sent to the graveyard!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:10.580
I activate the Continuous Spell, Cynet Codec!

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:14.220
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.150
Link Summon!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.900
Link 2 Code Talker!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:23.800
Cynet Codec’s effect activates!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:28.830
I add a Cyberse in my deck with 
the same Attribute to my hand.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:36.740
I can use Micro Coder from my hand to 
Link Summon a Code Talker Link Monster!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:40.840
Appear again!  The circuit 
that leads to the future!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:43.000
Link Summon!

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:47.140
Appear, Link 3 Encode Talker!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:53.490
But that’s still far 
weaker than Perfectron.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:56.590
Our duel is only getting started!

00:11:56.590 --> 00:12:00.200
I activate Cynet Codec’s effect again!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:04.940
We add the Light Attribute Cyberse 
Gadget from our deck to our hand!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.780
I activate Micro Coder's effect 
that was sent to the graveyard!

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:12.610
I add Cynet Optimization 
from my deck to my hand.

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:16.530
And I summon Cyberse Gadget!

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:23.290
Due to its effect, I Special Summon a Level 
2 or lower monster from my graveyard.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.790
Resurrect, Micro Coder!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:30.500
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.360
Link Summon!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:37.280
Appear, Link 2 Cyberse Witch!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:42.250
I activate SIMM Tablir’s 
effect from my hand!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.970
I add Clock Wyvern from 
my graveyard to my hand...

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:49.610
...to Special Summon SIMM Tablir 
next to Cyberse Witch’s link!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.620
Cyberse Witch’s effect!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.300
I banish Cynet Fusion from my graveyard...

00:12:55.300 --> 00:13:00.500
...to add Cyberse Magician and Cynet 
Ritual from my deck to my hand.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.730
And Cyberse Witch’s effect activates!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.280
Resurrect, Widget Kid!

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:13.970
Widget Kid’s effect lets us Special 
Summon Clock Wyvern from our hand!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.680
I activate the Ritual Spell, Cynet Ritual!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:26.340
I tribute Level 3 Widget Kid and 
Level 5 SIMM Tablir to Ritual Summon!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.650
Appear, Cyberse Magician!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.190
Ritual Summon…

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:42.630
I overlay Level 4 Clock Wyvern and Cyberse 
Gadget to build the Overlay Network!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.670
Xyz Summon!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:57.170
Appear, Rank 4 Firewall eXceed Dragon!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.520
An Xyz Summon this time?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:05.320
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.360
Link Summon!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:12.360
Link 3 Transcode Talker!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:17.520
He used his Xyz Monster to Link Summon?

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:23.440
What's he trying to do 
with all these summons?

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:29.980
It seems you can’t hear the 
voices of everyone guiding me!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.050
Voices?

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:37.280
Because the Neuron Link was destroyed?

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:37.920
No.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:43.730
You can’t hear them because you have 
no desire to connect with others.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:50.150
The world you want to create is a selfish 
world that steps on everyone’s hearts.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:53.020
No matter how many minds 
you steal, without heart...

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:56.040
...you’ll never hear the voices 
that guide to the future!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.140
My heart?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:06.300
I can hear everyone's 
voices yearning for peace.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.590
Here I go!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:11.520
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Cynet Codec’s effect!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:15.830
I add the Earth Attribute Code 
Generator from my deck to my hand!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.500
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Cynet Optimization!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.500
I can summon another Cyberse!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.800
I summon Code Generator!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:31.440
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:42.720
I set Cyberse Magician, Code Generator and 
Link 3 Transcode Talker in the Link Markers!

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.360
Circuit combine!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:45.820
What?

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.570
The mysterious power filling the universe!

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:55.030
Rain on the miracle star 
and create infinite life!

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.000
Link Summon!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:04.380
Appear, Link 5 Firewall Dragon Darkfluid!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.620
Impossible!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:11.900
There's only one Link 5 
monster - the one I created!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.720
Why do you have one?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:19.260
This is the power everyone entrusted to us!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.730
When Darkfluid is Link Summoned...

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:29.200
...if there are Cyberse Fusion, Ritual, 
Synchro and Xyz monsters in the graveyard...

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.440
...I put 4 counters on it!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.780
Battle!

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:40.380
Firewall Dragon Darkfluid attacks 
Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:46.170
It doesn’t have enough 
ATK to destroy Perfectron.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.800
You’re wrong!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:55.590
During battle, Darkfluid gains 
2500 ATK for each counter!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:58.130
So it gains 10000!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.300
Go, Darkfluid!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:04.370
Neo Tempest Flame!

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:13.900
Due to Judgment Arrows’s effect, 
Perfectron’s ATK are doubled!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:19.820
And when Perfectron has a counter, 
battle damage becomes 0!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.790
Then Perfectron’s effect!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:27.820
By removing a counter, it won't be destroyed!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:32.840
But Perfectron’s ATK decrease!

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.930
So what?

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:40.000
When Perfectron battles, here's its effect!

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.610
All monsters on your field are destroyed.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:47.610
It all went to waste, Playmaker.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.240
Your Darkfluid is destroyed-

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:52.320
No, that goes to waste.

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.320
Darkfluid’s effect activates!

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:58.100
When your monster activates its effect,

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:02.570
I remove a counter to negate that effect’s activation!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:06.300
And Darkfluid can attack again!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.130
What?

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.820
Battle again!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:13.160
Darkfluid attacks Perfectron!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.610
Neo Tempest Aqua!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:21.910
Due to Perfectron’s 
effect, I take 0 damage!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:26.950
By removing a counter, it won't be destroyed!

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.920
Now Perfectron’s ATK are even lower!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.860
Now Darkfluid’s effect!

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:38.730
Karma Gear!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.570
This is…

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:44.940
You finally noticed, Bohman.

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:48.910
You’ve fallen into a destruction 
combo that you can’t escape!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:54.370
This is the power my friends 
entrusted to me and Playmaker!

00:18:55.480 --> 00:19:03.650
Playmaker, you instantly figured out 
Darkfluid’s power and perfected this combo?

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:09.660
By bonding with others, humans 
can evolve beyond imagination.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.330
Everyone’s voices guided me here.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.430
That’s the power of connection!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:18.140
Go, Darkfluid!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:21.040
Neo Tempest Earth!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:25.110
Perfectron’s destruction is negated!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:32.820
But Perfectron’s ATK decreased again!

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:34.540
Karma Gear!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.290
Perfectron’s destruction effect is negated!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.770
Darkfluid attacks again!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:43.260
Neo Tempest Windy!

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.830
Due to Perfectron’s 
effect, it's not destroyed!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.670
But it’s not over!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:02.290
Now you have 0 counters!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:04.880
In other words, it has 0 ATK!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:09.370
And Perfectron can’t use its 
effect to avoid destruction!

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:11.790
Eat this!

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:15.260
This attack combines everyone’s powers!

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:19.230
Go, Firewall Dragon Darkfluid!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.730
Neo Tempest End!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:35.300
Playmaker…  So this is the 
duel you were going for.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.920
What I can hear in my heart is…

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.380
Brother…

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:48.330
You did it, Playmaker!

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.660
Well done.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.700
You may have a future that I don’t.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.760
Bohman…

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:02.270
Since I lost the duel, I'll vanish soon.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:09.760
Ai, by siding with the humans, you closed 
the Ignis’s future with your own hands.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:10.670
What?

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.320
I hope you don’t regret it.

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.050
Bohman…

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:20.520
Farewell, my ultimate rival Playmaker!

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:32.100
Haru…  You came for me.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:35.210
Let’s go, Brother.

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:41.680
Yeah.  From now on, we’ll 
be together forever.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.620
We won.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:22:00.500
Yeah.  But the cost was too high.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:09.420
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:16.870
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:23.840
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:26.810
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:34.350
The next sentimental

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:45.600
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:52.040
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:57.240
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:07.620
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:13.050
Are you ready?

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.400
Oh oh oh

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:23.600
Are you ready?

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:30.710
Are you ready?

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:43.240
With the end of battle, 
Mirror LINK VRAINS vanishes.

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:49.900
Though it's all over, Playmaker looks sullen.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:54.680
Unable to save his friends, Ai 
is also stricken with grief.

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.980
They feel empty.

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:03.850
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Journey to the End

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:05.850
Into the VRAINS!
